    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25712" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαρμόζω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάρκ-ττω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distribute in various places,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1451
			</span></i> (lyr.): hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>arrange, dispose,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα πρὸς τὸ μέλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.25.5
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τρόπον τοῦτον
			διηρμοσμένοι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.1
			</span></i>; <i>regulate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.88a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
